        "id": "ana",
        "name": "Ana"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Alexstrasza offers a lot of raw healing and barely any utility, therefore she struggles against enemey Heroes that have access to healing reduction effects (such as Deckard Cain with Emerald at Level 7).\n\nShe suffers against area of effect Abilities (such as Concussion Mine by Junkrat) and/or burst damage (for example Flamestrike by Kael'thas) used on Abundance's location.\n\nHeroes that can stick to Alexstrasza and interrupt (such as Yrel) Dragonqueen and/or Cleansing Flame can put serious pressure on her.\n\nDragonqueen can be countered by making Alexstrasza unable to act (for example Cocoon by Anub'arak) or by forcing a disengage (like Mighty Gust by Falstad)."
  },
