    "explanation": "Alexstrasza heavily prefers Maps that feature a static Objectives with a long cooldown, a single location, and a moderate duration (notably Infernal Shrines) because Dragonqueen can unfold its full potential for a team fight that, if won, will directly translate to taking down a Fort or even a Keep.\n\nThe worst Maps for Alexstrasza are the ones where having good sustain healing during the early game is extremely important (in particular Braxis Holdout, but also any other 2-lane Map)."
