    {
      "name": "Flame Buffet Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Alexstrasza's Flame Buffet Build provides good self-sustain to increase your survivability during team fights and massively improves your Dragonqueen in the late game at the cost of healing and early-game power.\n\nAncient Flame at Level 20 greatly empowers Dragonqueen, allowing you to single-handedly win team fights if the enemy team does not play around it. Slow enemies with Heat Exhaustion at Level 4 and heal yourself with Fire Within at Level 7.\n\nWe do not recommend playing this Build on Maps where the early game is important (notably Braxis Holdout) because it provides low sustain healing and needs to scale into the late game.",
